contentText:
Lizzo is closing out the month in a &#8220;Special&#8221; way, making her Sports Illustrated cover debut for the magazine&#8217;s July 2026 Swimsuit digital issue.

The &#8220;About Damn Time&#8221; singer wore her signature Yitty Swim bikinis and swimsuits for the poolside, Miami mansion-set shoot, marking a second of two recent Sports Illustrated moments. In the spring (May 30), Lizzo performed several songs from her new Bitch album, including &#8220;Sexy Ladies,&#8221; at the 2026 SI Swimsuit Runway Show during Miami Swim Week. The 38-year-old worked the catwalk in a bright blue one-piece swimsuit with the word &#8220;b—h&#8221; written across the front, a nod to her latest LP.

